<http://data.silknow.org/object/a0d838a0-1a1e-3a87-b84b-4ad03a572933>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "June 10, 2014 - March 8, 2015" , "The coordinated fabrics that make up the jacket and trousers of the Oscar de la Renta suit explicitly refer to the exuberant naturalism of late 18th-century silk woven textiles. This circa 1800 Portuguese or Spanish example features vases framed by floral garlands and doves holding olive twigs; such patterns reflect the aristocratic taste for pastoral themes and the idyllic country life, as expressed by the Neoclassical aesthetic style." , "“Insnared with flowers, I fall on grass\"" ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/1a7cb883-4509-3b01-a86f-e013bc10761e> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    "Exhibition" ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "“Insnared with flowers, I fall on grass\"" , "June 10, 2014 - March 8, 2015" , "The coordinated fabrics that make up the jacket and trousers of the Oscar de la Renta suit explicitly refer to the exuberant naturalism of late 18th-century silk woven textiles. This circa 1800 Portuguese or Spanish example features vases framed by floral garlands and doves holding olive twigs; such patterns reflect the aristocratic taste for pastoral themes and the idyllic country life, as expressed by the Neoclassical aesthetic style." ;
        schema:contentUrl   <https://risdmuseum.org/exhibitions-events/exhibitions/insnared-flowers-i-fall-grass> .
